      <h3 class="major">Step 1: Come as a guest</h3>
      <p>The easiest way to experience BH II is to walk in to one of our regular meetings. Guests are always welcome — no need to register in advance and no pressure to speak.</p>
      <p>As a guest, you will be warmly introduced to the room if you are happy to be, invited (but never required) to try Table Topics, and can simply sit back and watch how a meeting runs. Most guests leave surprised at how friendly and low-pressure it feels.</p>

